    "evidence": "The section is visually cohesive and demo-ready across all three viewports: strong editorial hierarchy, disciplined dark palette, consistent cyan/amber/red semantics, polished borders, and responsive card restructuring. Mobile preserves the narrative order particularly well. Minor deductions: several mono labels and source/footer lines are undersized and low-contrast; the desktop hero leaves excessive unused space; and the global header becomes visually cramped, with clipped navigation at desktop and truncated items beside “MORE” on mobile.",
